# Declared divergences for test/verify-space-scaffold.sh
#
# One line per disagreement that has been decided and recorded:
#
#   <path relative to home/>    <why, and where the decision is recorded>
#
# This file is not a place to silence the gate. It records that a difference was *found*, a person
# decided which of the two is right, and the decision is written down. When the difference is
# resolved, delete its line — the gate then holds the two copies together again.
#
# An undeclared difference is a failure, because a copy in either direction destroys content.
